ِجْمَعْ", "plain": "اِجْمَعْ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/4bb6124b6f1cb4be1055.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anti", "arabic": "اِجْمَعِي", "plain": "اِجْمَعِي", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/178e3356a6698adb2476.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antuma", "arabic": "اِجْمَعَا", "plain": "اِجْمَعَا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/dd03d62e8bf317971ec6.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "arabic": "اِجْمَعُوا", "plain": "اِجْمَعُوا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/cc75e8dd7443a3746dbc.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antunna", "arabic": "اِجْمَعْنَ", "plain": "اِجْمَعْنَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/5793a742e75252c6b094.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}], "ayat": [{"ref": "34:26", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3632.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Say: Our Lord will bring us all together, then He will judge between us with truth. He is the All-knowing Judge.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "De ki: \"Rabbimiz hepimizi bir araya toplayacak, sonra da hak hükmü ile aramızı ayıracaktır. Asıl hüküm veren ve her şeyi bilen O'dur.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تم فرماؤ ہمارا رب ہم سب کو جمع کرے گا پھر ہم میں سچا فیصلہ فرمادے گا اور وہی ہے بڑا نیاؤ چکانے (درست فیصلہ کرنے) والا سب کچھ جانتا،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Katakanlah: \"Tuhan kita akan mengumpulkan kita semua, kemudian Dia memberi keputusan antara kita dengan benar. Dan Dialah Maha Pemberi keputusan lagi Maha Mengetahui\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قُلْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَجْمَعُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/3bfc795e1c40efd40558.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "he/it gathers", "bs": "okuplja", "tr": "toplar", "fr": "il rassemble", "id": "dia mengumpulkan", "ur": "وہ جمع کرتا ہے", "bn": "সে একত্র করে", "fa": "گرد می‌آورد"}}, {"text": "بَيْنَنَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَبُّنَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَفْتَحُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بَيْنَنَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِٱلْحَقِّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَهُوَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْفَتَّاحُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْعَلِيمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "104:2", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/6181.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Who hath gathered wealth (of this world) and arranged it.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Mal toplayıp onu tekrar tekrar sayan, insanları arkadan çekiştirip, kaş göz hareketleriyle alay edenlerin (hümeze ve lümezenin) vay haline!", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "جس نے مال جوڑا اور گن گن کر رکھا،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "yang mengumpulkan harta dan menghitung-hitung,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "ٱلَّذِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "جَمَعَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/2fa9b3a7fcec7c936ea2.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "sakupio je", "en": "he gathered", "tr": "topladı", "fr": "il a amassé", "id": "dia mengumpulkan", "ur": "اس نے جمع کیا", "bn": "সে জমা করেছে", "fa": "جمع کرد"}}, {"text": "مَالًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَعَدَّدَهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "77:38", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5660.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "This is the Day of Decision, We have brought you and the men of old together.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Bu, işte o hüküm günüdür. Sizi ve öncekileri bir araya topladık.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "یہ ہے فیصلہ کا دن، ہم نے تمہیں جمع کیا اور سب اگلوں کو", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Ini adalah hari keputusan; (pada hari ini) Kami mengumpulkan kamu dan orang-orang terdahulu.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "هَٰذَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَوْمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْفَصْلِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "جَمَعْنَٰكُمْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/9476fdd5c218c1b68a20.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "we gathered you (all)", "bs": "okupili smo vas", "tr": "sizi topladık", "fr": "nous vous avons rassemblés", "id": "kami telah mengumpulkan kalian", "ur": "ہم نے تمہیں جمع کیا", "bn": "আমরা তোমাদের একত্র করেছি", "fa": "شما را گرد آوردیم"}}, {"text": "وَٱلْأَوَّلِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "10:58", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1422.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Say: In the bounty of Allah and in His mercy: therein let them rejoice. It is better than what they hoard.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "De ki, \"Allah'ın ihsanıyla ve rahmetiyle, yalnızca bunlarla sevinç duysunlar. Bu, onların biriktirip durduklarından daha hayırlıdır.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تم فرماؤ اللہ ہی کے فضل اور اسی کی رحمت اور اسی پر چاہیے کہ خوشی کریں وہ ان کے سب دھن دولت سے بہتر ہے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Katakanlah: \"Dengan kurnia Allah dan rahmat-Nya, hendaklah dengan itu mereka bergembira. Kurnia Allah dan rahmat-Nya itu adalah lebih baik dari apa yang mereka kumpulkan\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قُلْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِفَضْلِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَبِرَحْمَتِهِۦ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَبِذَٰلِكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَلْيَفْرَحُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هُوَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "خَيْرٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِّمَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَجْمَعُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/72ff6c60d609c08bcafe.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "they amass", "bs": "sakupljaju", "tr": "biriktirirler", "fr": "ils amassent", "id": "mereka mengumpulkan", "ur": "وہ جمع کرتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা জমা করে", "fa": "گردآوری می‌کنند"}}]}, {"ref": "75:3", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5554.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Thinketh man that We shall not assemble his bones?", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "İnsan, kendisinin kemiklerini bir araya toplayamayacağımızı mı sanıyor?", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "کیا آدمی یہ سمجھتا ہے کہ ہم ہرگز اس کی ہڈیاں جمع نہ فرمائیں گے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Apakah manusia mengira, bahwa Kami tidak akan mengumpulkan (kembali) tulang belulangnya?", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "أَيَحْسَبُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَلَّن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نَّجْمَعَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/d086696e5ac13cd69246.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "sakupit ćemo", "en": "We will gather", "tr": "toplayacağız", "fr": "Nous rassemblerons", "id": "Kami akan mengumpulkan", "ur": "ہم جمع کریں گے", "bn": "আমরা একত্র করব", "fa": "گرد خواهیم آورد"}}, {"text": "عِظَامَهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "يَجْمَعُونَ", "count": 3, "first": "3:157", "audio": "audio/368bdc87f56d55a6e0ba.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "they amass", "bs": "sakupljaju", "tr": "biriktirirler", "fr": "ils amassent", "id": "mereka mengumpulkan", "ur": "وہ جمع کرتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা জমা করে", "fa": "گردآوری می‌کنند"}}, {"arabic": "يَجْمَعُ", "count": 3, "first": "5:109", "audio": "audio/aaec9285e530e9799c01.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it gathers", "bs": "okuplja", "tr": "toplar", "fr": "il rassemble", "id": "dia mengumpulkan", "ur": "وہ جمع کرتا ہے", "bn": "সে একত্র করে", "fa": "گرد می‌آورد"}}, {"arabic": "لَيَجْمَعَنَّكُمْ", "count": 2, "first": "4:87", "audio": "audio/3e9c84a8587c22859577.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": ["antum"], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "surely he/it will gather you (all)", "bs": "zaista će vas okupiti", "tr": "kesinlikle sizi toplayacak", "fr": "il vous rassemblera assurément", "id": "sungguh dia akan mengumpulkan kalian", "ur