: "الْحَدِيقَةِ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "bašti", "en": "the garden", "bn": "বাগান", "fa": "باغ", "fr": "le jardin", "id": "taman", "tr": "bahçe", "ur": "باغ"}}]}]}